"  disco. El Windows de dentro quiere unos 4 GB de memoria y 32 GB de disco solo\n"
"  para él."

msgctxt "vm_cabe_bem"
msgid "This computer can take it: it has {1} of memory and {2} free on disk."
msgstr "Esta computadora aguanta: tiene {1} de memoria y {2} libres en disco."

msgctxt "vm_texto"
msgid ""
"There is a heavier road, and for a case like this one it works:\n"
"\n"
"  run a REAL Windows inside Linux, and let only the program's window appear\n"
"  here on your screen, as if it were a program from here. The two programs that\n"
"  do this are WinBoat and WinApps, both free. Because it is a real Windows, a\n"
"  system driver works, and the USB protection key can be handed over to it.\n"
"\n"
"  {1}\n"
"\n"
"  What it costs, and it is better to know beforehand: you need a Windows\n"
"  licence, and it has to be the Pro edition — Home will not do, because it does\n"
"  not let the window out. And the Windows inside takes up disk and memory the\n"
"  whole time.\n"
"\n"
"  Tandem does not install this and will not: it is a different kind of program.\n"
"  But it would have been dishonest to say \"there is no way\" without saying that\n"
"  this way exists."
msgstr ""
"Existe un camino más pesado, y para un caso como este funciona:\n"
"\n"
"  ejecutar un Windows DE VERDAD dentro de Linux, y dejar que solo la ventana\n"
"  del programa aparezca aquí en la pantalla, como si fuera un programa de aquí.\n"
"  Los dos programas que hacen esto son WinBoat y WinApps, ambos gratis. Como es\n"
"  un Windows de verdad, un driver de sistema funciona, y la llave USB de\n"
"  protección se le puede entregar.\n"
"\n"
"  {1}\n"
"\n"
"  Lo que cuesta, y conviene saberlo antes: hace falta una licencia de Windows,\n"
"  y tiene que ser la edición Pro — la Home no sirve, porque no deja salir la\n"
"  ventana. Y el Windows de dentro ocupa disco y memoria todo el tiempo.\n"
"\n"
"  Tandem no instala esto y no lo va a instalar: es otro tipo de programa. Pero\n"
"  era deshonesto decir \"no hay manera\" sin decir que esta manera existe."

